        "original_id": "5fb1fcdc-24b4-5a3f-8826-4d35f27d9492",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: Toyota Owners 400\n- Companies: Crown Royal, Diageo, Seagram\n- Concepts: race title sponsorship, essay contest, Daytona Speedweeks\n\nFacts:\n- In 2000, Diageo purchased Crown Royal when the Seagram portfolio was dissolved.\n- Crown Royal is a blended Canadian whisky owned by Diageo.\n- From 2007 to 2011, Crown Royal was the former title sponsor of the Toyota Owners 400 race.\n- From 2007 to 2011, Crown Royal named the Toyota Owners 400 after the winner of an essay contest held during Daytona Speedweeks.",
